          "message": {
            "text": "The production-funnel oracle exercises both emitters plus declared, system, emoji-priority, dotted-circle, terminal-notdef, feature, and disabled-cluster transitions. It withholds the verdict unless every selected Domotion PostScript face occurs in Chromium CDP evidence and every mutation/control is live. The collected macOS report passed all nine cases; this is representative transition evidence, not a claim of exhaustive host-font coverage.",
            "markdown": "The production-funnel oracle exercises both emitters plus declared, system, emoji-priority, dotted-circle, terminal-notdef, feature, and disabled-cluster transitions. It withholds the verdict unless every selected Domotion PostScript face occurs in Chromium CDP evidence and every mutation/control is live. The collected macOS report passed all nine cases; this is representative transition evidence, not a claim of exhaustive host-font coverage."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
