          "message": {
            "text": "The real renderer-route producer authenticates the selected helper with its --version output and binary bytes before rendering. A headless macOS run produced evidence-complete with all 29 records native-observed; the explicit cache-invalidation test proves DOMOTIONDISABLEHELPER moves the production predicate and yields an incomparable ledger identity.",
            "markdown": "The real renderer-route producer authenticates the selected helper with its --version output and binary bytes before rendering. A headless macOS run produced evidence-complete with all 29 records native-observed; the explicit cache-invalidation test proves DOMOTION_DISABLE_HELPER moves the production predicate and yields an incomparable ledger identity."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/renderer-font-route-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 96,
                  "endLine": 111,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "async function main(): Promise<number> {\n  const helperObserved = isGlyphHelperAvailable();\n  const helperPath = resolvedGlyphHelperPathForEvidence();\n  const helperImplementationIdentity = helperPath == null\n    ? \"\"\n    : createHash(\"sha256\")\n      .update(execFileSync(helperPath, [\"--version\"], { encoding: \"utf8\" }).trim())\n      .update(\"\\0\")\n      .update(readFileSync(helperPath))\n      .digest(\"hex\");\n  const helperEnvironment = helperRouteLedgerEnvironment(helperAvailabilityContract({\n    platform: process.platform as \"darwin\" | \"linux\" | \"win32\",\n    helperObserved,\n    explicitlyDisabled: process.env.DOMOTION_DISABLE_HELPER === \"1\",\n    implementationIdentity: helperImplementationIdentity,\n  }));"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
